  "description": "*“I'm addicted to dopamine.”*\n\nIn my life, which is already steeped in dopamine, an event occurs that triggers a massive dopamine rush. At a convenience store I happened to stop by, I got a headshot from the clerk, and found myself transported along with other players into the hellishly difficult game \\[Apocalypse: Safe Zone\\]… \n\nAnd I am the only veteran player who has seen every ending, including the hidden zone, in this game.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
